; Technology File: gpdk090
; THIS RULE FILE IS USED FOR TOP LEVEL ROUTING WHERE YOU DO NOT WANT THE 
; ROUTER TO ROUTE OVER THE BLOCKS. THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN THIS FILE AND 
; icc.rules FILE IS THE SECTION OF iccKeepouts(). 
; There is a logical AND function between prBoundary and all Metal(1 to 9) 
; layer to prevent CCAR routing over any block in the design.

